		"Brock spawns in caves, plateaus, mountains and hills."
		""
		"Gym leaders are RCT key trainers. They spawn near you in their favourite biomes once you've beaten the key trainers before them (rivals, Team Rocket); gyms 1-4 will also live in the hub town."
		""
		"Your whole party must be at or under your level cap to battle."
